<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Demand was moderate. Top $56.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 55.00-55.50, some 56.00</p>
<p>Sows - firm/up $1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 42.00-46.00</p>
<p>		 400-500 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
<p>		 500-600 lbs. 48.00-51.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 50.00-52.00</p>
</text>
